            ""Can I use components in commercial client projects?"",
            ""Yes — your Pro license grants unlimited use in commercial work with no cap on revenue or end products. The only restriction is that you cannot resell the components as a competing component library.""),
        new(""refunds"",
            ""Do you offer refunds?"",
            ""We offer a 14-day money-back guarantee on every plan with no questions asked. Refunds land back on your original payment method within 5–7 business days of approval.""),
        new(""install"",
            ""How do I install components into an existing project?"",
            ""Use the shadcn CLI with `npx shadcn@latest add [component]` or copy the source directly from any block page. Components drop into existing shadcn/ui projects without configuration changes and follow the same install patterns you already know.""),
        new(""plan-changes"",
            ""Can I upgrade or downgrade my plan?"",
            ""Yes, change your plan anytime from account settings. Upgrades apply immediately with prorated billing, and downgrades take effect at the end of your current billing period so you keep the value you've already paid for.""),
        new(""frameworks"",
